// One site written twice: under the contract 1 names (Spanish keys,
// `plataforma: "1"`) and under the contract 2 names. Contract 1 tests read
// both and compare, so every key the contract 1 reading renames is used at
// least once: the config and its header fields, the menu with an object
// entry, a type with `etiqueta` and `vista`, fields with every renamed key
// and kind, entities with `fuente` and `actualizado`, and page headers.

